# AgriChain Role-Based Dashboard Implementation Plan

This document outlines the architecture and steps to build the production-ready Role-Based Dashboard Module for both Farmers and Buyers, integrating Wallet-Based Authentication (Wagmi + Viem), ShadCN UI, Recharts, and role-based routing.

## User Review Required

> [!WARNING]
> **Authentication Flow Change**
> You specified "No password login. Wallet Address = Identity." This means we will remove the traditional email/password registration and login forms. Users will exclusively authenticate using MetaMask (Wagmi + Viem).

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **New Dependencies**
> We will need to install the following packages in the frontend to support the requested features:
> - `wagmi`, `viem`, `@tanstack/react-query` (Wallet Auth)
> - `recharts` (Analytics charts)
> - `clsx`, `tailwind-merge`, `@radix-ui/react-slot` (ShadCN UI base)

## Open Questions

> [!CAUTION]
> **Backend Implementation Scope**
> While this dashboard requires many endpoints (e.g., fetching products, orders, payments, analytics), building all these full backend Rust Axum endpoints + MongoDB queries in one go is massive. 
